1249 |       // ── L-shape sofa ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
1250 |       // An L-sofa is defined by:
1251 |       //   corner:  (cornerR, cornerC) — the inner corner cell
1252 |       //   lenA:    horizontal arm length (≥ 2)
1253 |       //   lenB:    vertical arm length   (≥ 2)
1254 |       //   variant: "se" | "sw" | "ne" | "nw"
1255 |       //
1256 |       //  "se": H arm → right, V arm → down   (corner = top-left  of bbox)
1257 |       //  "sw": H arm → left,  V arm → down   (corner = top-right)
1258 |       //  "ne": H arm → right, V arm → up     (corner = bottom-left)
